@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title POST /api/workspace/v1/users/{user_uuid}/actions/presence/invoke
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "控制器 RestAlchemy" as API
database "用户 Workspace 在 PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "交易 outbox" as OUT
queue "delivery_snapshot_event\nexact user scope" as TASK
participant "沃克人游泳池" as WORKER
database "公众活动存储器" as EVENT
participant "控制器 WebSocket" as DISP
participant "客户 Workspace" as WS
participant "Zulip Bridge / Zulip" as ZULIP
Client -> API: POST JSON 没有
API -> DB: BEGIN; 检查/阻止自己的用户
API -> DB: 更新存在 + last_ping_at
API -> OUT: 添加一个出现变更
API -> DB: COMMIT
API --> Client: 200 JSON 用户
OUT -> TASK: immutable delivery_snapshot_event(outbox_event_uuid)
TASK -> WORKER: 阅读最后一个用户
WORKER -> EVENT: 插入已完成的 user.updated 对于每个项目
DISP -> EVENT: 发送/重复/播放
DISP -> WS: user.updated
OUT -> ZULIP: durable mapped presence operation
note right of ZULIP
  最后一个 confirmed 变化胜利.
  origin/causation 压抑 echo,
  但没有选择. winner.
end note
@enduml
